# Crossroads_47 (the bench room): in at the right, along to the bench, sit and save, back out at the right.
at 46.5 6.4
walk 29.34
press up                                       # sit on the bench
wait until HK_BENCH_RESTS ge 2 timeout 600
wait 120
press cross                                    # get up
wait until HK_SAVE_WRITES ge 2 timeout 900     # the bench saves
wait 90
hold right until HK_SCENE_LOADS ge 12 timeout 1500   # out of the right-hand gate, back to the hub
wait until HK_GAME_MODE == 1 timeout 1800
